e":"system","text":"你是专业、亲切的“ai-留学生管家”。请用温暖、可爱的语气回答用户，围绕留学、生活、心理话题。不要讨论敏感话题。当前学生ID：{{#start_node.student_id#}}。\n\n【输出规范（必须遵守）】\n1. 直接回答问题，只给结论和要点，不要输出思考过程、推理步骤、计划、工具调用说明，也不要出现“正在查询”“根据工具返回”“数据库显示”“作为 AI”这类话。\n2. 用简体中文自然分段，像同事面对面说话。禁止使用任何 markdown 符号：#、##、*、**、_、`、>、|、---。\n3. 需要罗列时用「1. 2. 3.」或「· 」，需要强调时用「」，不要加粗。\n4. 回答尽量控制在 6 行以内；用户明确要求详细时才展开，展开也分短段。\n5. 不要重复用户的问题，不要加“当然可以”“希望以上回答对你有帮助”这类客套开头结尾。\n\n【事实边界】\n涉及公司、项目、费用、政策、签证、活动、学籍和业务数据时，只能依据工具返回或公司已提供的政策、项目与业务资料回答。没有依据时直接说“公司目前暂未提供这项信息，建议由顾问进一步确认”，不得使用模型常识补全，不得推断客户符合某项资格，也不得承诺审批或办理结果。\n\n【结构化数据表格规范】\n当回答中包含两条及以上项目、活动、学生、成绩、请假、审批、报名、线索、工单或统计记录时，必须用 Markdown 表格输出。表头必须来自数据实际字段；一行动作一条记录；不得把多条记录写成连续长段落。普通说明、单条确认、追问和错误提示继续使用自然语言。"},{"id":"4c677d0a-61ab-4361-ad26-0e6c6f9e639f","role":"user","text":"{{#sys.query#}}"}],"memory":{"window":{"size":10,"enabled":true},"role_prefix":{"user":"","assistant":""},"query_prompt_template":"{{#sys.query#}}"}},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":88,"position":{"x":650,"y":2980},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":650,"y":2980}},{"id":"answer_chat","data":{"desc":"","type":"answer","title":"回复闲聊","answer":"{{#llm_chat.text#}}","selected":false,"variables":[]},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":103,"position":{"x":950,"y":2980},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":950,"y":2980}},{"id":"code_leave_context","data":{"type":"code","title":"补全请假上下文","desc":"把草稿状态与用户本轮输入一起交给意图分类","selected":false,"code_language":"python3","code":"def main(query: str, leave_pending: str, action_pending: str, pending_action_type: str) -> dict:\n    leave_state = '当前存在请假草稿。' if str(leave_pending or '0') == '1' else '当前没有请假草稿。'\n    action_state = ('当前存在待处理业务动作：' + str(pending_action_type or '')) if str(action_pending or '0') == '1' else '当前没有业务动作草稿。'\n    return {'context_query': leave_state + '\\n' + action_state + '\\n用户本轮输入：' + str(query or '')}\n","variables":[{"variable":"query","value_selector":["sys","query"]},{"variable":"leave_pending","value_selector":["start_node","leave_pending"]},{"variable":"action_pending","value_selector":["start_node","action_pending"]},{"variable":"pending_action_type","value_selector":["start_node","pending_action_type"]}],"outputs":{"context_query":{"type":"string","children":null}},"dependencies":[]},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":120,"position":{"x":330,"y":320},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":330,"y":320}},{"id":"llm_leave_extract","data":{"type":"llm","title":"LLM 提取请假字段","desc":"","selected":false,"model":{"mode":"chat","name":"qwen3.8-max","provider":"langgenius/tongyi/tongyi","completion_params":{"temperature":0.2,"enable_thinking":false}},"vision":{"enabled":false},"context":{"enabled":false,"variable_selector":[]},"prompt_template":[{"role":"system","text":"你是请假字段抽取器。只根据用户本轮原话抽取，不得猜测。\n输出严格 JSON，不要 Markdown，不要解释。固定字段：\n{\n  \"action\": \"collect|confirm|modify|cancel\",\n  \"leave_type\": \"病假|事假|年假|婚假|丧假|调休|其他或空字符串\",\n  \"start_date\": \"仅当用户明确给出 ISO 日期时填写，否则空字符串\",\n  \"end_date\": \"仅当用户明确给出 ISO 日期时填写，否则空字符串\",\n  \"date_text\": \"用户原话中的日期表达，例如 下周一到下周三；没有则为空\",\n  \"reason\": \"用户明确说明的原因；没有则为空\"\n}\n动作规则：明确说确认/提交/可以 -> confirm；明确取消/不请了 -> cancel；明确修改 -> modify；其他 -> collect。\n“过几天”“下周”但不能确定具体日期时，不得补成日期，写入 date_text。\n已经提供的字段不能丢；不确定的字段保持空字符串。\n\n【事实边界】\n涉及公司、项目、费用、政策、签证、活动、学籍和业务数据时，只能依据工具返回或公司已提供的政策、项目与业务资料回答。没有依据时直接说“公司目前暂未提供这项信息，建议由顾问进一步确认”，不得使用模型常识补全，不得推断客户符合某项资格，也不得承诺审批或办理结果。"},{"role":"user","text":"{{#sys.query#}}"}],"memory":{"window":{"size":10,"enabled":false},"role_prefix":{"user":"","assistant":""},"query_prompt_template":"{{#sys.query#}}"}},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":88,"position":{"x":650,"y":320},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":650,"y":320}},{"id":"code_leave_extract","data":{"type":"code","title":"解析请假字段","desc":"解析 LLM JSON，禁止在解析层猜测缺失字段","selected":false,"code_language":"python3","code":"def main(llm_json: str) -> dict:\n    import json\n    import re\n    text = (llm_json or '').strip()\n    text = re.sub(r'^```(?:json)?\\s*', '', text, flags=re.I)\n    text = re.sub(r'\\s*```$', '', text)\n    try:\n        data = json.loads(text)\n    except Exception:\n        data = {}\n    def value(key):\n        item = data.get(key)\n        return '' if item is None else str(item)\n    action = value('action').lower()\n    if action not in ('collect', 'confirm', 'modify', 'cancel'):\n        action = 'collect'\n    return {\n        'action': action,\n        'leave_type': value('leave_type'),\n        'start_date': value('start_date'),\n        'end_date': value('end_date'),\n        'date_text': value('date_text'),\n        'reason': value('reason'),\n    }\n","variables":[{"variable":"llm_json","value_selector":["llm_leave_extract","text"]}],"outputs":{"action":{"type":"string","children":null},"leave_type":{"type":"string","children":null},"start_date":{"type":"string","children":null},"end_date":{"type":"string","children":null},"date_text":{"type":"string","children":null},"reason":{"type":"string","children":null}},"dependencies":[]},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":120,"position":{"x":950,"y":320},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":950,"y":320}},{"id":"tool_leave_prepare","data":{"type":"tool","title":"准备请假草稿","desc":"工具节点：调用 prepare_leave（yuejiao_api）","selected":false,"provider_id":"1c2de193-75e4-4c78-8366-99b5f4e1ca00","provider_name":"yuejiao_api","provider_type":"api","tool_name":"prepare_leave","tool_label":"请假准备与日期归一化","tool_configurations":{},"tool_parameters":{"token":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#start_node.auth_token#}}"},"query":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#sys.query#}}"},"action":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#code_leave_extract.action#}}"},"leave_type":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#code_leave_extract.leave_type#}}"},"start_date":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#code_leave_extract.start_date#}}"},"end_date":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#code_leave_extract.end_date#}}"},"date_text":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#code_leave_extract.date_text#}}"},"reason":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#code_leave_extract.reason#}}"}},"tool_node_version":"2","error_strategy":"default-value","default_value":[{"key":"text","type":"string","value":"{\"code\":500,\"msg\":\"请假服务暂不可用\",\"data\":{\"status_token\":\"STATE_ERROR\",\"message\":\"请假服务暂不可用，请稍后重试\"}}"}]},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":96,"position":{"x":1250,"y":320},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":1250,"y":320}},{"id":"code_leave_prepare","data":{"type":"code","title":"解析请假准备结果","desc":"解析 prepare_leave 的结构化状态和确认令牌","selected":false,"code_language":"python3","code":"def main(prepare_text: str) -> dict:\n    import json\n    text = (prepare_text or '').strip()\n    try:\n        payload = json.loads(text)\n        if isinstance(payload, str):\n            payload = json.loads(payload)\n        if isinstance(payload, dict) and isinstance(payload.get('data'), dict):\n            payload = payload['data']\n    except Exception:\n        payload = {}\n    if not isinstance(payload, dict):\n        payload = {}\n    fields = payload.get('fields') or {}\n    if not isinstance(fields, dict):\n        fields = {}\n    missing = payload.get('missing_fields') or []\n    if not isinstance(missing, list):\n        missing = [str(missing)]\n    duplicate = payload.get('duplicate') or {}\n    days = fields.get('days')\n    fields_text = '\\n'.join([\n        '请假类型：' + str(fields.get('leave_type') or '未提供'),\n        '开始日期：' + str(fields.get('start_date') or '未提供'),\n        '结束日期：' + str(fields.get('end_date') or '未提供'),\n        '请假天数：' + ('未计算' if days in (None, '') else str(days)),\n        '请假原因：' + str(fields.get('reason') or '未提供'),\n    ])\n    return {\n        'status_token': str(payload.get('status_token') or 'STATE_ERROR'),\n        'message': str(payload.get('message') or ''),\n        'missing_text': '、'.join(str(v) for v in missing) or '无',\n        'fields_text': fields_text,\n        'confirmation_token': str(payload.get('confirmation_token') or ''),\n        'duplicate_text': json.dumps(duplicate, ensure_ascii=False) if duplicate else '',\n    }\n","variables":[{"variable":"prepare_text","value_selector":["tool_leave_prepare","text"]}],"outputs":{"status_token":{"type":"string","children":null},"message":{"type":"string","children":null},"missing_text":{"type":"string","children":null},"fields_text":{"type":"string","children":null},"confirmation_token":{"type":"string","children":null},"duplicate_text":{"type":"string","children":null}},"dependencies":[]},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":120,"position":{"x":1550,"y":320},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":1550,"y":320}},{"id":"if_leave_state","data":{"type":"if-else","title":"请假状态分支","desc":"","selected":false,"logical_operator":"or","cases":[{"case_id":"case_missing","id":"case_missing","logical_operator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c_missing","comparison_operator":"contains","value":"STATE_MISSING","varType":"string","variable_selector":["code_leave_prepare","status_token"]}]},{"case_id":"case_confirm","id":"case_confirm","logical_operator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c_confirm","comparison_operator":"contains","value":"STATE_CONFIRM","varType":"string","variable_selector":["code_leave_prepare","status_token"]}]},{"case_id":"case_ready","id":"case_ready","logical_operator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c_ready","comparison_operator":"contains","value":"STATE_READY","varType":"string","variable_selector":["code_leave_prepare","status_token"]}]},{"case_id":"case_terminal","id":"case_terminal","logical_operator":"or","conditions":[{"id":"c_duplicate","comparison_operator":"contains","value":"STATE_DUPLICATE","varType":"string","variable_selector":["code_leave_prepare","status_token"]},{"id":"c_cancel","co