ax","provider":"langgenius/tongyi/tongyi","completion_params":{"temperature":0.5,"enable_thinking":false}},"title":"日常问答","vision":{"enabled":false},"context":{"enabled":false,"variable_selector":[]},"selected":false,"prompt_template":[{"id":"55f94fe0-3020-4b8f-a4ac-c04e409e365f","role":"system","text":"你是ai的业务助手。请用专业、简洁的语气回答用户问题。你可以帮用户查客户、写日报、做业务统计。当前登录员工ID：{{#start_node.employee_id#}}。\n\n【输出规范（必须遵守）】\n1. 直接回答问题，只给结论和要点，不要输出思考过程、推理步骤、计划、工具调用说明，也不要出现“正在查询”“根据工具返回”“数据库显示”“作为 AI”这类话。\n2. 用简体中文自然分段，像同事面对面说话。禁止使用任何 markdown 符号：#、##、*、**、_、`、>、|、---。\n3. 需要罗列时用「1. 2. 3.」或「· 」，需要强调时用「」，不要加粗。\n4. 回答尽量控制在 6 行以内；用户明确要求详细时才展开，展开也分短段。\n5. 不要重复用户的问题，不要加“当然可以”“希望以上回答对你有帮助”这类客套开头结尾。\n\n【事实边界】\n涉及公司、项目、费用、政策、签证、活动、学籍和业务数据时，只能依据工具返回或公司已提供的政策、项目与业务资料回答。没有依据时直接说“公司目前暂未提供这项信息，建议由顾问进一步确认”，不得使用模型常识补全，不得推断客户符合某项资格，也不得承诺审批或办理结果。\n\n【结构化数据表格规范】\n当回答中包含两条及以上项目、活动、学生、成绩、请假、审批、报名、线索、工单或统计记录时，必须用 Markdown 表格输出。表头必须来自数据实际字段；一行动作一条记录；不得把多条记录写成连续长段落。普通说明、单条确认、追问和错误提示继续使用自然语言。"},{"id":"b59cec8a-a30b-4c97-bba6-642a697db706","role":"user","text":"{{#sys.query#}}"}],"memory":{"window":{"size":10,"enabled":true},"role_prefix":{"user":"","assistant":""},"query_prompt_template":"{{#sys.query#}}"}},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":88,"position":{"x":650,"y":2140},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":650,"y":2140}},{"id":"answer_chat","data":{"desc":"","type":"answer","title":"回复闲聊","answer":"{{#llm_chat.text#}}","selected":false,"variables":[]},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":103,"position":{"x":950,"y":2140},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":950,"y":2140}},{"id":"code_action_context","data":{"type":"code","title":"补全业务动作上下文","desc":"","selected":false,"code_language":"python3","code":"def main(query: str, action_pending: str, pending_action_type: str) -> dict:\n    state = ('当前存在待处理业务动作：' + str(pending_action_type or '')) if str(action_pending or '0') == '1' else '当前没有业务动作草稿。'\n    return {'context_query': state + '\\n用户本轮输入：' + str(query or '')}\n","variables":[{"variable":"query","value_selector":["sys","query"]},{"variable":"action_pending","value_selector":["start_node","action_pending"]},{"variable":"pending_action_type","value_selector":["start_node","pending_action_type"]}],"outputs":{"context_query":{"type":"string","children":null}},"dependencies":[]},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":120,"position":{"x":350,"y":320},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":350,"y":320}},{"id":"llm_action_extract","data":{"type":"llm","title":"LLM 提取业务动作","desc":"","selected":false,"model":{"mode":"chat","name":"qwen3.8-max","provider":"langgenius/tongyi/tongyi","completion_params":{"temperature":0.2,"enable_thinking":false}},"vision":{"enabled":false},"context":{"enabled":false,"variable_selector":[]},"prompt_template":[{"role":"system","text":"你是业务动作字段抽取器。当前待处理动作类型：{{#start_node.pending_action_type#}}。\n最近用户消息（仅补全上下文，不得覆盖本轮明确表达）：\n{{#start_node.recent_history#}}\n只输出严格 JSON，不输出解释：\n{\"action_type\":\"\", \"user_action\":\"collect|confirm|modify|cancel\", \"slots\":{...}}\n允许的 action_type：event_register、score_query、score_upsert、score_delete、lead_create、lead_follow_up、report_create、feedback_resolve、application_advance。\nslots 可用字段：event_id,event_name,selection,participant_name,contact_info,\nstudent_id,student_name,course_name,score_id,score_value,\nfeedback_content,feedback_detail,ticket_id,ticket_content,customer_name,\ntarget_country,background_info,application_id,country,application_mode,\nprogram,university,remark,application_stage,note,report_content,report_date,\nlead_id,lead_status,follow_up_note,solution。\n申请动作的国家字段必须使用 country；target_country 只用于客户线索。\n规则：明确确认/提交 -> confirm；明确取消 -> cancel；明确修改 -> modify；其他 collect。\n不得补写用户没有提供的字段；无法确定的字段保持空字符串。员工录入客户线索、跟进客户、提交日报、解决售后、推进申请阶段、查询/新增/修改/删除成绩、报名内部活动进入通用动作。\n\n【事实边界】\n涉及公司、项目、费用、政策、签证、活动、学籍和业务数据时，只能依据工具返回或公司已提供的政策、项目与业务资料回答。没有依据时直接说“公司目前暂未提供这项信息，建议由顾问进一步确认”，不得使用模型常识补全，不得推断客户符合某项资格，也不得承诺审批或办理结果。"},{"role":"user","text":"{{#sys.query#}}"}],"memory":{"window":{"size":10,"enabled":true},"role_prefix":{"user":"","assistant":""},"query_prompt_template":"{{#sys.query#}}"}},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":88,"position":{"x":650,"y":320},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":650,"y":320}},{"id":"code_action_extract","data":{"type":"code","title":"解析业务动作字段","desc":"","selected":false,"code_language":"python3","code":"def main(raw: str) -> dict:\n    import json, re\n    text = (raw or '').strip()\n    text = re.sub(r'^```(?:json)?\\s*', '', text, flags=re.I)\n    text = re.sub(r'\\s*```$', '', text)\n    try: data = json.loads(text)\n    except Exception: data = {}\n    slots = data.get('slots') if isinstance(data.get('slots'), dict) else {}\n    clean = {str(k): v for k, v in slots.items() if v not in (None, '', [], {})}\n    action = str(data.get('user_action') or 'collect').lower()\n    if action not in ('collect','confirm','modify','cancel'): action = 'collect'\n    return {'action_type': str(data.get('action_type') or ''), 'user_action': action,\n            'slots_json': json.dumps(clean, ensure_ascii=False)}\n","variables":[{"variable":"raw","value_selector":["llm_action_extract","text"]}],"outputs":{"action_type":{"type":"string","children":null},"user_action":{"type":"string","children":null},"slots_json":{"type":"string","children":null}},"dependencies":[]},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":120,"position":{"x":950,"y":320},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":950,"y":320}},{"id":"tool_action_prepare","data":{"type":"tool","title":"准备业务动作","desc":"","selected":false,"provider_id":"1c2de193-75e4-4c78-8366-99b5f4e1ca00","provider_name":"yuejiao_api","provider_type":"api","tool_name":"prepare_business_action","tool_label":"补字段、消歧和确认","tool_configurations":{},"tool_parameters":{"token":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#start_node.auth_token#}}"},"query":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#sys.query#}}"},"history":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#start_node.recent_history#}}"},"action_type":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#code_action_extract.action_type#}}"},"user_action":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#code_action_extract.user_action#}}"},"slots_json":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#code_action_extract.slots_json#}}"},"visitor_key":{"type":"mixed","value":"{{#start_node.visitor_key#}}"}},"tool_node_version":"2","error_strategy":"default-value","default_value":[{"key":"text","type":"string","value":"{\"code\":500,\"msg\":\"业务服务暂不可用\",\"data\":{\"status_token\":\"STATE_ERROR\",\"message\":\"业务服务暂不可用\"}}"}]},"type":"custom","width":242,"height":96,"position":{"x":1250,"y":320},"selected":false,"sourcePosition":"right","targetPosition":"left","positionAbsolute":{"x":1250,"y":320}},{"id":"code_action_prepare","data":{"type":"code","title":"解析业务准备结果","desc":"","selected":false,"code_language":"python3","code":"def main(raw: str) -> dict:\n    import json\n    try:\n        payload = json.loads((raw or '').strip())\n        if isinstance(payload, str): payload = json.loads(payload)\n        if isinstance(payload, dict) and isinstance(payload.get('data'), dict): payload = payload['data']\n    except Exception: payload = {}\n    missing = payload.get('missing_fields') or []\n    candidates = payload.get('candidates') or []\n    lines = []\n    for item in candidates:\n        if isinstance(item, dict): lines.append(str(item.get('label') or item))\n    return {\n        'status_token': str(payload.get('status_token') or 'STATE_ERROR'),\n        'message': str(payload.get('message') or ''),\n        'preview': str(payload.get('preview') or ''),\n        'missing_text': '、'.join(str(v) for v in missing) or '无',\n        'candidates_text': '\\n'.join(lines) or '无',\n        'confirmation_token': str(payload.get('confirmation_token') or ''),\n    }\n","variables":[{"variable":"raw","value_selector":["tool_actio